[Host] The very first store.

71
00:08:12,803 --> 00:08:15,156
[Vocab] それまで

72
00:08:15,555 --> 00:08:16,875
[Host] Until then.

73
00:08:17,475 --> 00:08:19,516
[Vocab] 約

74
00:08:19,915 --> 00:08:21,379
[Host] Approximately.

75
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:24,500
[Vocab] 欠かせない

76
